{
    "title": "MoneyGram\u00ae Money Transfers App",
    "description": "THE MONEYGRAM\u00ae MONEY TRANSFERS APP\r\n\r\nThe MoneyGram app provides the speed, flexibility and freedom to move money on your terms. That\u2019s why we\u2019re now the title sponsor of Haas F1 Team \u2013 our mutual commitments to innovation, technology, speed and safety help us better develop the products and services you need.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s convenient to transfer money using the MoneyGram Money Transfers app! Transfer funds directly into bank accounts, mobile wallets or for cash pickup in 200+ countries and territories.\r\n\r\nSEND MONEY INTERNATIONALLY & WITHIN THE US\r\n\r\nYou know and love our international money transfers that make it fast, easy and reliable to send money to over 200 countries and territories around the globe. But did you know you can also transfer money to your friends and family within the United States? Simply select the U.S. as the receive country to estimate fees and start online money transfers to your loved ones here at home.\r\n\r\nYou can send money to India, Mexico, Jamaica, Vietnam, El Salvador, Honduras, Philippines, Haiti, Afghanistan, Bengladesh, and so many more.\r\n\r\nPAY THOUSANDS OF BILLERS\r\n\r\nMoneyGram has over 13,000 companies you can pay using our money transfer app. Paying bills with us is convenient and reliable and lets you use the payment method of your choice. \r\n\r\nEARN DISCOUNTS WITH MONEYGRAM PLUS REWARDS\u00ae\r\n\r\nEarn up to 40% off future money transfers when you join MoneyGram Plus Rewards! The more often you send, the more rewards you get when you join our no-cost loyalty program. Check out our top member benefits:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Get 20% off your 2nd transfer after joining, applied automatically at checkout\r\n\u2022 Get 40% off after every 5th transfer after joining, applied automatically at checkout\r\n\u2022 Exclusive promotions and offers available only to Plus Rewards members\r\n\r\nPlus, you\u2019ll be automatically enrolled when you create your MoneyGram online profile \u2013 no action needed from you! But, if it\u2019s not your thing, you can always opt-out. \r\n\r\nMORE FEATURES ON THE MONEYGRAM APP\r\n\r\n\u2022 Set up easy automatic, recurring online money transfers on a weekly or monthly basis\r\n\u2022 Stage a cash transfer at one of our thousands of convenient locations\r\n\u2022 Estimate fees before you begin a new online wire transfer\r\n\u2022 Receive notifications and track the status of money transfers you\u2019ve sent or are expecting to receive\r\n\u2022 Find your nearest MoneyGram agent location to send wire transfers in-store\r\n\u2022 Access your profile quickly and easily with biometric login\r\n\u2022 Enjoy enhanced security with 24/7 monitoring of online activity\r\n\r\nWhen you download and use MoneyGram\u00ae app, you agree to the MoneyGram Terms of Use: https://www.moneygram.com/mgo/us/en/m/terms-of-use\r\n\r\nLEGAL\r\n\r\nFEES AND IMPORTANT DISCLOSURES\r\n \r\nMoneyGram makes money from both transfer fees and currency exchange. When selecting a money transfer operator, carefully compare both transfer fees and currency exchange rates. Transfer fees, foreign currency exchange rates and taxes may vary based on transaction details such as transfer amount, destination country, payment type, delivery method and pick up location. Fees and rates may be subject to change without notice.  Please use care when providing payment and receiver account information.  Funds will be taken from and paid into the account information provided by the sender.\r\n\r\nThe MoneyGram\u00ae Money Transfers app will display available services based on your location. Not all services will be available in all countries. The app supports the same send and receive countries shown on our website, www.moneygram.com\r\n\r\nMoneyGram, the Globe and MoneyGram Plus Rewards are marks of MoneyGram. \r\n\r\nAuthorized to do business in all 50 states, D.C. and all U.S. territories, NMLS # 898432. Licensed as a Money Transmitter by the New York State Department of Financial Services. Massachusetts Check Seller License # CS0025, Foreign Transmittal License # FT89432. \r\n\r\n\u00a9 2014-2024 MoneyGram\r\n\r\nMoneyGram - 2828 N Harwood St #15, Dallas, TX 75201",
    "descriptionHTML": "THE MONEYGRAM\u00ae MONEY TRANSFERS APP<br><br>The MoneyGram app provides the speed, flexibility and freedom to move money on your terms. That\u2019s why we\u2019re now the title sponsor of Haas F1 Team \u2013 our mutual commitments to innovation, technology, speed and safety help us better develop the products and services you need.<br><br>It\u2019s convenient to transfer money using the MoneyGram Money Transfers app! Transfer funds directly into bank accounts, mobile wallets or for cash pickup in 200+ countries and territories.<br><br>SEND MONEY INTERNATIONALLY &amp; WITHIN THE US<br><br>You know and love our international money transfers that make it fast, easy and reliable to send money to over 200 countries and territories around the globe. But did you know you can also transfer money to your friends and family within the United States? Simply select the U.S. as the receive country to estimate fees and start online money transfers to your loved ones here at home.<br><br>You can send money to India, Mexico, Jamaica, Vietnam, El Salvador, Honduras, Philippines, Haiti, Afghanistan, Bengladesh, and so many more.<br><br>PAY THOUSANDS OF BILLERS<br><br>MoneyGram has over 13,000 companies you can pay using our money transfer app. Paying bills with us is convenient and reliable and lets you use the payment method of your choice. <br><br>EARN DISCOUNTS WITH MONEYGRAM PLUS REWARDS\u00ae<br><br>Earn up to 40% off future money transfers when you join MoneyGram Plus Rewards! The more often you send, the more rewards you get when you join our no-cost loyalty program. Check out our top member benefits:<br><br>\u2022 Get 20% off your 2nd transfer after joining, applied automatically at checkout<br>\u2022 Get 40% off after every 5th transfer after joining, applied automatically at checkout<br>\u2022 Exclusive promotions and offers available only to Plus Rewards members<br><br>Plus, you\u2019ll be automatically enrolled when you create your MoneyGram online profile \u2013 no action needed from you! But, if it\u2019s not your thing, you can always opt-out. <br><br>MORE FEATURES ON THE MONEYGRAM APP<br><br>\u2022 Set up easy automatic, recurring online money transfers on a weekly or monthly basis<br>\u2022 Stage a cash transfer at one of our thousands of convenient locations<br>\u2022 Estimate fees before you begin a new online wire transfer<br>\u2022 Receive notifications and track the status of money transfers you\u2019ve sent or are expecting to receive<br>\u2022 Find your nearest MoneyGram agent location to send wire transfers in-store<br>\u2022 Access your profile quickly and easily with biometric login<br>\u2022 Enjoy enhanced security with 24/7 monitoring of online activity<br><br>When you download and use MoneyGram\u00ae app, you agree to the MoneyGram Terms of Use: https://www.moneygram.com/mgo/us/en/m/terms-of-use<br><br>LEGAL<br><br>FEES AND IMPORTANT DISCLOSURES<br> <br>MoneyGram makes money from both transfer fees and currency exchange. When selecting a money transfer operator, carefully compare both transfer fees and currency exchange rates. Transfer fees, foreign currency exchange rates and taxes may vary based on transaction details such as transfer amount, destination country, payment type, delivery method and pick up location. Fees and rates may be subject to change without notice.  Please use care when providing payment and receiver account information.  Funds will be taken from and paid into the account information provided by the sender.<br><br>The MoneyGram\u00ae Money Transfers app will display available services based on your location. Not all services will be available in all countries. The app supports the same send and receive countries shown on our website, www.moneygram.com<br><br>MoneyGram, the Globe and MoneyGram Plus Rewards are marks of MoneyGram. <br><br>Authorized to do business in all 50 states, D.C. and all U.S. territories, NMLS # 898432. Licensed as a Money Transmitter by the New York State Department of Financial Services. Massachusetts Check Seller License # CS0025, Foreign Transmittal License # FT89432. <br><br>\u00a9 2014-2024 MoneyGram<br><br>MoneyGram - 2828 N Harwood St #15, Dallas, TX 75201",
